                                "sense_id": "a151e566-7bad-3d07-bd01-55b54029d927",
                                "text": "« Et je dis aussi que bien que ce soit un armet, ce n’est pas un armet entier. ¶ – Non certes, s’écria don Quichotte, car il lui manque une moitié, qui est la mentonnière. »",
                                "translation": "\"And I say that as much as it is an armet, it is not an entire armet\" ¶ \"Certainly not,\" exclaimed Don Quixote, \"as it is missing a half, which is the beaver.\"",
                                "english": "\"And I say that as much as it is an armet, it is not an entire armet\" ¶ \"Certainly not,\" exclaimed Don Quixote, \"as it is missing a half, which is the beaver.\""
                            }
